# Bright Data credentials.
# Preferred: run `npx -p @brightdata/cli bdata login` instead — it stores an OAuth
# session in the CLI's own config and no key ever lands on disk in this repo.
#
# Only use this file if you must pass a raw key (e.g. CI). Never commit it.
BRIGHTDATA_API_KEY=

# Optional: override where the ledger is written.
# ANANSI_LEDGER=./data/ledger.json
